<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>My Journey With Veeresh</title>

    <!-- Google Font -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>

        /* =========================================================
           GLOBAL
        ========================================================= */

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
            color: #24324a;

            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(120, 119, 198, 0.16), transparent 28%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(255, 183, 197, 0.20), transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, rgba(104, 211, 145, 0.12), transparent 30%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fbff, #fff8f5 48%, #f7f5ff);

            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           FLOATING PARTICLES
        ========================================================= */

        .particles {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            overflow: hidden;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .particle {
            position: absolute;
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.18);
            animation: floatParticle linear infinite;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(1) {
            left: 8%;
            animation-duration: 16s;
            animation-delay: -4s;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(2) {
            left: 22%;
            animation-duration: 21s;
            animation-delay: -10s;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(3) {
            left: 38%;
            animation-duration: 18s;
            animation-delay: -6s;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(4) {
            left: 55%;
            animation-duration: 24s;
            animation-delay: -12s;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(5) {
            left: 72%;
            animation-duration: 19s;
            animation-delay: -8s;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(6) {
            left: 88%;
            animation-duration: 23s;
            animation-delay: -15s;
        }

        @keyframes floatParticle {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(110vh) scale(0.5);
                opacity: 0;
            }

            15% {
                opacity: 1;
            }

            85% {
                opacity: 1;
            }

            100% {
                transform: translateY(-10vh) scale(1.2);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        /* =========================================================
           NAVBAR
        ========================================================= */

        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;

            height: 72px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;

            padding: 0 7%;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);

            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);

            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .logo {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 20px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            color: #3949ab;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 28px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #3949ab;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           HERO
        ========================================================= */

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;

            min-height: 100vh;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            padding: 120px 7% 80px;

            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 950px;

            animation: heroAppear 1.2s ease forwards;
        }

        @keyframes heroAppear {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(35px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;

            padding: 9px 17px;

            border-radius: 50px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);

            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);

            color: #6366f1;

            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;

            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);

            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: clamp(52px, 9vw, 110px);

            line-height: 0.98;

            letter-spacing: -4px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    120deg,
                    #334155,
                    #4f46e5,
                    #8b5cf6,
                    #db2777
                );

            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;

            color: transparent;

            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 30px);

            font-weight: 500;

            color: #475569;

            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .hero-description {
            max-width: 720px;

            margin: auto;

            font-size: 17px;

            line-height: 1.9;

            color: #64748b;
        }

        .scroll-down {
            margin-top: 55px;

            display: inline-flex;

            flex-direction: column;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 8px;

            color: #94a3b8;

            font-size: 12px;

            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }

            50% {
                transform: translateY(8px);
            }
        }

        /* =========================================================
           COMMON SECTION
        ========================================================= */

        section {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;

            padding: 110px 7%;
        }

        .section-heading {
            text-align: center;

            max-width: 760px;

            margin: 0 auto 70px;
        }

        .section-heading span {
            color: #6366f1;

            font-size: 13px;

            font-weight: 800;

            text-transform: uppercase;

            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .section-heading h2 {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px);

            margin: 15px 0;

            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .section-heading p {
            color: #64748b;

            line-height: 1.8;

            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           INTRO CARD
        ========================================================= */

        .story-intro {
            max-width: 950px;

            margin: auto;

            padding: 55px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);

            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);

            border-radius: 30px;

            box-shadow:
                0 30px 80px rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.08);

            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);

            line-height: 1.95;

            color: #475569;

            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .story-intro strong {
            color: #3949ab;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           TIMELINE
        ========================================================= */

        .timeline {
            position: relative;

            max-width: 1000px;

            margin: auto;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: "";

            position: absolute;

            left: 50%;

            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;

            width: 2px;

            transform: translateX(-50%);

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    to bottom,
                    transparent,
                    #a5b4fc,
                    #c4b5fd,
                    #f9a8d4,
                    transparent
                );
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;

            width: 50%;

            padding: 25px 45px;

            opacity: 0;

            transform: translateY(40px);

            transition: 0.8s ease;
        }

        .timeline-item.visible {
            opacity: 1;

            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
            left: 0;

            text-align: right;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            left: 50%;
        }

        .timeline-dot {
            position: absolute;

            top: 38px;

            width: 17px;
            height: 17px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background: #6366f1;

            border: 4px solid #fff;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 0 5px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.13),
                0 6px 18px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);

            z-index: 2;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) .timeline-dot {
            right: -8px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-dot {
            left: -8px;
        }

        .timeline-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);

            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);

            padding: 30px;

            border-radius: 24px;

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 50px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.07);

            transition: 0.35s ease;
        }

        .timeline-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px);

            box-shadow:
                0 28px 65px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);
        }

        .timeline-card .year {
            font-size: 12px;

            font-weight: 800;

            color: #8b5cf6;

            text-transform: uppercase;

            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        .timeline-card h3 {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 27px;

            margin: 10px 0 14px;

            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .timeline-card p {
            color: #64748b;

            line-height: 1.8;

            font-size: 15px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           VEERESH SECTION
        ========================================================= */

        .veeresh-section {
            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    rgba(238, 242, 255, 0.8),
                    rgba(250, 245, 255, 0.8)
                );
        }

        .qualities {
            max-width: 1050px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(3, 1fr);

            gap: 22px;
        }

        .quality-card {
            padding: 35px;

            border-radius: 25px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);

            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.13);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 45px rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.06);

            transition: 0.35s;
        }

        .quality-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
        }

        .quality-icon {
            font-size: 30px;

            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .quality-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;

            font-size: 20px;

            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .quality-card p {
            color: #64748b;

            line-height: 1.7;

            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           MOVIES
        ========================================================= */

        .movies-grid {
            max-width: 1100px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));

            gap: 18px;
        }

        .movie {
            min-height: 150px;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            text-align: center;

            padding: 25px;

            border-radius: 22px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9),
                    rgba(245, 243, 255, 0.9)
                );

            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12);

            box-shadow:
                0 15px 35px rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.06);

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 21px;

            color: #334155;

            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .movie:hover {
            transform:
                translateY(-8px)
                rotate(1deg);

            box-shadow:
                0 25px 55px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.13);
        }

        /* =========================================================
           MEMORIES
        ========================================================= */

        .memory-container {
            max-width: 950px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(2, 1fr);

            gap: 25px;
        }

        .memory {
            padding: 38px;

            border-radius: 25px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 50px rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.07);

            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.13);

            transition: 0.35s;
        }

        .memory:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
        }

        .memory-number {
            font-size: 13px;

            color: #6366f1;

            font-weight: 800;

            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .memory h3 {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 26px;

            margin-bottom: 12px;

            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .memory p {
            color: #64748b;

            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           CAREER SECTION
        ========================================================= */

        .career {
            max-width: 950px;

            margin: auto;

            padding: 55px;

            border-radius: 30px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9),
                    rgba(239, 246, 255, 0.9)
                );

            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12);

            box-shadow:
                0 30px 80px rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.08);

            text-align: center;
        }

        .career h3 {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 40px;

            color: #1e293b;

            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .career p {
            max-width: 750px;

            margin: auto;

            color: #64748b;

            line-height: 1.9;

            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .career-highlight {
            margin-top: 30px;

            display: inline-block;

            padding: 12px 20px;

            border-radius: 50px;

            background: #eef2ff;

            color: #4f46e5;

            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           FINAL LETTER
        ========================================================= */

        .letter-section {
            padding-bottom: 130px;
        }

        .letter {
            max-width: 900px;

            margin: auto;

            padding: 70px 65px;

            position: relative;

            border-radius: 32px;

            background: #fff;

            box-shadow:
                0 35px 90px rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.10);

            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.13);

            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .letter::before {
            content: "“";

            position: absolute;

            top: -45px;
            right: 35px;

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 190px;

            color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.06);
        }

        .letter h2 {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 44px;

            color: #1e293b;

            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .letter p {
            color: #526174;

            line-height: 2;

            font-size: 16px;

            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .letter .name {
            margin-top: 35px;

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 30px;

            color: #4f46e5;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 5px;

            color: #94a3b8;

            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           FOOTER
        ========================================================= */

        footer {
            text-align: center;

            padding: 45px 20px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);

            border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);

            color: #94a3b8;

            font-size: 13px;
        }

        footer strong {
            color: #6366f1;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           RESPONSIVE
        ========================================================= */

        @media (max-width: 800px) {

            nav {
                padding: 0 5%;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            section {
                padding: 80px 5%;
            }

            .hero {
                padding-left: 5%;
                padding-right: 5%;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                letter-spacing: -2px;
            }

            .story-intro,
            .career,
            .letter {
                padding: 35px 25px;
            }

            .timeline::before {
                left: 10px;
            }

            .timeline-item,
            .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
                width: 100%;
                left: 0;

                padding-left: 40px;
                padding-right: 0;

                text-align: left;
            }

            .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) .timeline-dot,
            .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-dot {
                left: 2px;
                right: auto;
            }

            .qualities {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .memory-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .letter h2 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }
        }

    </style>
</head>


<body>

<!-- =========================================================
     FLOATING BACKGROUND
========================================================= -->

<div class="particles">
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
</div>


<!-- =========================================================
     NAVIGATION
========================================================= -->

<nav>

    <div class="logo">
        S × V
    </div>

    <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#story">Our Story</a>
        <a href="#journey">Journey</a>
        <a href="#memories">Memories</a>
        <a href="#movies">Movies</a>
        <a href="#letter">Letter</a>
    </div>

</nav>


<!-- =========================================================
     HERO
========================================================= -->

<header class="hero">

    <div class="hero-content">

        <div class="eyebrow">
            ✦ A Story That Was Never Planned
        </div>

        <h1>
            My Journey<br>
            With Veeresh
        </h1>

        <h2>
            From classmates to an unexpected friendship.
        </h2>

        <p class="hero-description">
            Sometimes the most important people in our lives
            are not the people we planned to meet.
            They simply become part of our journey —
            one ordinary day at a time.
        </p>

        <a href="#story" class="scroll-down">
            ↓
            <span>Scroll to begin</span>
        </a>

    </div>

</header>


<!-- =========================================================
     INTRO
========================================================= -->

<section id="story">

    <div class="section-heading">

        <span>The Beginning</span>

        <h2>
            We Didn't Know
            What Was Coming
        </h2>

        <p>
            In B.Tech, Veeresh and I were simply classmates.
            Nothing extraordinary. Nothing dramatic.
            Just two people studying in the same college.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="story-intro">

        <p>
            During the first three years of B.Tech, I didn't know
            Veeresh that well. We were classmates, and that was
            pretty much it.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            One day, my best friends went on a college trip to
            Maredumilli without telling me. Honestly, I wasn't
            interested in going anyway, so I didn't join them.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            At that time, Veeresh's batch also didn't go on the trip.
            Somehow, I started spending time with his batch during
            lunch. It was only for a few days, but those few days
            quietly changed the direction of my college life.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            When my friends returned from the trip, things were
            different. The communication wasn't the same anymore.
            I didn't really understand what had happened.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            Then <strong>4th year started.</strong>
        </p>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     JOURNEY TIMELINE
========================================================= -->

<section id="journey">

    <div class="section-heading">

        <span>The Turning Point</span>

        <h2>
            One Seat Changed Everything
        </h2>

        <p>
            Sometimes a friendship doesn't begin with a big moment.
            Sometimes it begins with simply finding a place to sit.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="timeline">


        <!-- 1 -->

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>

            <div class="timeline-card">

                <div class="year">
                    4th Year • Day One
                </div>

                <h3>
                    The Empty Seat
                </h3>

                <p>
                    For three years, I had sat beside my best friends.
                    But after the trip, everything felt different.
                    When I asked Manoj if I could sit in my usual place,
                    he told me there was no space.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- 2 -->

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>

            <div class="timeline-card">

                <div class="year">
                    The Next Chapter
                </div>

                <h3>
                    A New Place
                </h3>

                <p>
                    I ended up sitting alone. Our class teacher noticed
                    and asked me to sit in the front. Veeresh's batch
                    was sitting there.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- 3 -->

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>

            <div class="timeline-card">

                <div class="year">
                    Slowly
                </div>

                <h3>
                    I Started Sitting With Them
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Day after day, I continued sitting with Veeresh's
                    batch. I had left my old group behind, and I still
                    didn't completely understand why things had changed.
                    But life was quietly introducing me to new people.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- 4 -->

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>

            <div class="timeline-card">

                <div class="year">
                    4th Year
                </div>

                <h3>
                    The Lunches
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Veeresh and his friends didn't bring lunch boxes.
                    They would eat at the college canteen, where a meal
                    cost around ₹60. At that time, I couldn't afford
                    that every day.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- 5 -->

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>

            <div class="timeline-card">

                <div class="year">
                    Something I Won't Forget
                </div>

                <h3>
                    "I'll Pay."
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Veeresh started giving me the money for lunch.
                    Because of him, I was able to have lunch with
                    them throughout 4th year. It may have seemed like
                    a small thing to him, but to me it meant a lot.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- 6 -->

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>

            <div class="timeline-card">

                <div class="year">
                    Somewhere Along The Way
                </div>

                <h3>
                    A Real Friendship
                </h3>

                <p>
                    What started as sitting in a different place
                    slowly became conversations, lunches, movies,
                    memories and a friendship I never expected.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


    </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     VEERESH
========================================================= -->

<section class="veeresh-section">

    <div class="section-heading">

        <span>About Veeresh</span>

        <h2>
            He Was Different
        </h2>

        <p>
            Not because he tried to prove it.
            It was simply the way he was.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="qualities">


        <div class="quality-card">

            <div class="quality-icon">
                🧠
            </div>

            <h3>
                Sharp Mind
            </h3>

            <p>
